OL,3,GNEWSAWoman hit by car left with
OL,4,Alife-changing injuries
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman in her 70s has been left with
OL,7,Flife-changing injuries after being hit
OL,8,Fby a car in a Waitrose car park.
OL,10,FCambridgeshire Police said it was
OL,11,Fcalled to Brays Lane, in Ely, at about
OL,12,F14:05 GMT on Friday after a white Mini
OL,13,FCooper collided with a 79-year-old
OL,14,Fwoman who was walking with a shopping
OL,15,Ftrolley.
OL,17,FPolice said the woman, from Ely, was
OL,18,Ftaken to Addenbrooke's Hospital in
OL,19,FCambridge.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
