OL,3,GNEWSAWoman hit by car left with
OL,4,Alife-changing injuries
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe driver of the car, a 64-year-old
OL,7,Fwoman from Wilburton, was uninjured and
OL,8,Fremained at the scene. The force said
OL,9,Fshe was helping with its inquiries.
